{"answer": 3, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span> 그래프에서 한쪽 극한을 각각 읽는다</div>\n    $$\n    \\lim_{x\\to0+}f(x)=2,\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to1-}f(x)=1.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> 더한다</div>\n    $$\n    2+1=3.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;③</div>\n"}